      "example": "7JQX1FswpQ8",
      "help_en": "The share ID. If you operate on a file through a share, include the `x-share-token` header for authentication and pass this field. In this case, `drive_id` is invalid. Otherwise, use an AccessKey pair or an access token for authentication and pass the `drive_id` field. You must specify either `share_id` or `drive_id`",
